<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"><title>Scan to Pay | NETS Vouch AI</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head>
  <body><main class="prototype-stage"><section class="phone-shell">
    <div class="status-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span>9:41</span><span class="status-bar__island"></span><span class="status-bar__signals">● ◢ ▰</span></div>
    <header class="app-bar"><div class="wordmark"><span class="wordmark__nets">NETS</span><span class="wordmark__vouch">Vouch</span></div><span class="prototype-label">Prototype</span></header>
    <div class="phone-viewport"><div class="screen screen--scanner">
      <header class="recommendation-heading"><a class="icon-button" href="/home">←</a><div><p class="eyebrow">Simulated QR payment</p><h1>Scan to Pay</h1></div></header>
      <div class="scanner-intro"><span>▣</span><div><h2>Point, scan, pay</h2><p>Try the fictional merchant QR below.</p></div></div>
      <div class="scan-frame"><i class="scan-corner scan-corner--tl"></i><i class="scan-corner scan-corner--tr"></i><i class="scan-corner scan-corner--bl"></i><i class="scan-corner scan-corner--br"></i><form method="POST" action="/scan"><button class="fictional-qr" type="submit" aria-label="Simulate scanning Café ABC"><span>NETS</span><strong>▦</strong><small>Tap to scan</small></button></form></div>
      <div class="scan-instruction"><strong>Tap the QR code to simulate scanning</strong><span>The QR is a normal form button</span></div>
      <div class="prototype-camera-note"><span>⊘</span><span><strong>No camera used</strong>This prototype never requests camera permission.</span></div><p class="scan-security">✓ Fictional QR · Contains no payment information</p>
    </div></div><div class="home-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </section></main><script src="/js/script.js"></script></body>
</html>
